{title: Lakhon Hai Yahan Dilwale}
{artist: Mahendra Kapoor O P Nayyar}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Laakho hai [C]yahaan dilwaale,
[G]aur pyaar [D]nahi milataa
[G]Aankho me kisi [C]ki vafaa kaa,
[D]iqaraar [C]nahi milataa
[G]Mahafil mahafil [C]jaa dekhaa,
[C]har dil me [G]samaa kar dekhaa
[C]Har saaz [D]pe gaa [G]kar dekhaa
[C]Dil ko kahi [G]chain naa milaa
[C]Are dil ko [G]kahi chain naa milaa
[C]Mai to [D]duniya me pyare [G]akela hi raha
[G]Is dil ko [C]kahaan le jaae,
[C]kuchh aap [G]agar faramaae
[C]To aap [D]ke ham [G]ho jaae
[C]Kah do [G]hame hasake zaraa
[C]Kah do [G]hame hasake zaraa
[C]Aji jo kuch [D]bhi dil ne [G]tumhare hai kaha
